  "rationale": "Confirmed App saves distinct recent ports before returning to the table and reloads them at startup. XDG_CONFIG_HOME selects its absolute directory, otherwise HOME/.config is used. When the target is absent, migration checks the prior Piraeus home file, the selected XDG pfm file, and the pfm home file; unit tests cover all three imports, persistence, and precedence of the target file. Habeas 0.2 review: checked the added per-function citations against the unchanged product code and its behavior tests; the refreshed inputs show the same implementation with explicit function references.",
